# THE ONKELOS ROWS of Deuteronomy 1:1-46 (THE DEUTERONOMY WALK sitting 1 — THE OPENING SPEECH, 2026-09-15): the frame and the date, Horeb, the
# officers, the spies, the oath, the defeat at Hormah. The Aramaic and the Hebrew CUT by consonants in GLOSSED PIECES of at most seven tokens
# (deu_ink.HP / AP — the lint's ninety-character window). The second file carries 2:1-37, the third 3:1-29. Speed ruling (c): a CONTEXT row is
# terse — the verse's words and the translation's plain rendering; a MATERIAL row carries the translation's move and the ink.
